INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(41749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That\'s what I\'m talking about! This beauty will pay a pretty sum of gold with those Shadowfo-... Oh, you\'re still here. Right! Your reward. Here, take this and some coin on top of it, you really made this goblin\'s day!', 0),
(41753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You are a faithful and obedient servant, $C. For your subservience, a reward awaits. Have this and be on your way, the Dark Lady does not appreciate needless loitering.', 0),
(41754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The markings are undoubtedly dwarven, reminiscent of the times before even the War of the Three Hammers! If you give me but a moment, I should be able to translate the message written upon this tablet…', 0),
(41755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A tablet about the Redbrand\'s past?! Incredible; quickly, let me inspect it!$B$B<Torwyn adjusts his lens and begins perusing his gaze across the tablet\'s stony surface. With each line he\'s deciphering and reading, he\'s becoming increasingly more red and sweaty, up until his hand is visibly shaking.>$B$BY-You…! WHERE DID YOU FIND THIS?! You will NEVER speak of this; never! No one is to know about this accursed tablet! Absolutely no one! Here, take this and your lips will remain sealed, am I clear?! Now begone!', 0),
(41756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good job, soldier. The more dead orcs I know of, the better I can sleep at night. It won\'t be long before we\'ve driven these mongrels out of the Wetlands for good. Keep fighting on, and you will always count on the aid of the sons of Khaz Modan.', 0),
(41757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good riddance. We\'ve dealt a serious blow to whatever Dragonmaw remained in Khaz Modan. Now it is up to us to clear up the mess and dispose of any remaining vermin skulking around in our lands. I salute to you, $N. You\'re a true hero in my eyes.', 0),
(41774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The Pedestal of Unity begins to click, and whirr into motion. A humming of foreign magic begins emanate, and the surface of the stone begins to glow blue. From the base of the stone pedestal emerges a tray which contains a singular key.>', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(41749, 0, 0, 'Don\'t leave me hanging, pal. You\'re the fifth adventurer I\'ve been tasking to get this damn stone.', 0),
(41753, 0, 0, 'These simpletons cannot comprehend the power they are meddling with. Once within our grasp, it can finally develop its full potential.', 0),
(41754, 0, 0, 'Welcome to our grand exhibition! Please, if you have any questions regarding our displays, don\'t hesitate to ask.', 0),
(41755, 0, 0, 'Greetings, what brings you to the esteemed Redbrand Estate?', 0),
(41756, 0, 0, 'Show \'em that the Alliance hasn\'t lost its bite.', 0),
(41757, 0, 0, 'Don\'t underestimate him. Beasts like him don\'t survive by sheer luck.', 0),
(41774, 0, 0, '<The Pedestal of Unity stands unbroken, and free from serious damage. It is weathered from age, and covered in dust. Upon its surface lay ancient dwarvish runes as well as two slots that hold some sort of square objects. From a first glance, it is easy to notice some ancient mechanism is requiring the positioning of a specific item to activate the magic within.>', 0);
